{"title":"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Integers can be written in bases other than the usual base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. For example, the notation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/8/eb84b1cb125eb9a92be9d53e92a76340394761b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(235)_{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> stands for the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> representation of the integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/7/2a71a7c4f2f4c4b5b6204826b42c60ace7a14143.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\times 7^{2} + 3 \\times 7 + 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" /> (which equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/c/71c1636bd2876630688f77deef38f6203e8a5875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$124$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"12\" /> in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />). In general, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> are integers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f0568af8d9dc0cd1c716666f8c19b645ac6342cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"41\" height=\"16\" />, inclusive, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/5/e35397a1aad05b57b6e9ec6f439122c097b8f913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(xyz)_{b} = xb^{2} + yb + z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"21\" />.<br />\nFind all triples <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/b/31b1e1af4531148cbc079023f68c2b0102c4ee69.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x, y, z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"61\" height=\"20\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/4/244b441220313a5f706d38e002c69218bb63a0b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(xyz)_{10} = 2(xyz)_{7}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\" />, where each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> comes from the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/daed80beb504ec2c25c905a2232ee8f460e060e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the defintion of bases, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af6e659a46cdef4994292f073c816f570d7b63c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100x + 10y + z = 2(49x + 7y + z)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"269\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/e/e3e51f345bf52c54a135c0d3ff50ebcae89416f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100x + 10y + z = 98x + 14y + 2z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/9/6e91c9566c9a55a7557254615f9ce536786d5bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x - 4y - z = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/4/7347e40c281ed3019ff5f77fc063106dac3626c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x - 2y) = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>From this, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/3/b13f21416d84e13708696f34dea81026cda583c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is even, so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df82385d8b789f76eaada1bdf893d0e1be0a4842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359d4caf8f6b3ac51865d6ab1cfbe67aac4585b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781a1eab5324128a6b9b805f38a10a53badd7f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df82385d8b789f76eaada1bdf893d0e1be0a4842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/3/9438ffd5ae74365d1a9a4f7d7f144726a372928f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than some multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/0/690ef55a607beaf2389d1ee102df817721bc2392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then it is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. The possible ordered pairs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/8/df82385d8b789f76eaada1bdf893d0e1be0a4842.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> are then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/5/4355c5eb2342cf439fc6c3b6bbb2efd8324bddca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(3, 1, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/40664d443d51858575d4a588621c154b8e0ea04e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(5, 2, 2)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359d4caf8f6b3ac51865d6ab1cfbe67aac4585b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/6/c26097cf69f0dfbc7454e7a01557cfaff3b66afe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cab3f0704de3232f601b03d02a45d46103c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> is even, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> must be even for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7577dc68d259db3e132917083c4ace9ce4d588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> to be even, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7da1b75cc1a945018db7316c26d618ca11ff9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cab3f0704de3232f601b03d02a45d46103c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, which isn't possible since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> must be positive. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea768618848c1aea8a32490c327911e8ab7243a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cab3f0704de3232f601b03d02a45d46103c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/7/ea7da1b75cc1a945018db7316c26d618ca11ff9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26cab3f0704de3232f601b03d02a45d46103c172.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"18\" height=\"15\" /> would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/d/b8db1c24a6c4d0ade195b8b098cfe96a64267735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. The possible ordered pairs for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/359d4caf8f6b3ac51865d6ab1cfbe67aac4585b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> are then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/1/5b142855b2f537b00495a6eca9bba51c42b8aa39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(4, 1, 4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/3/973bf9d89d7cc65a39c89d2aee21d07dd5ebbfac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(6, 2, 4)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781a1eab5324128a6b9b805f38a10a53badd7f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7df46fc616a4d51eab63bfbb565ce1dde7eff2b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"86\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> would have to be odd since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/7/ba7577dc68d259db3e132917083c4ace9ce4d588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 2y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> is odd, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> would be greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> has to be positive, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3be1b6d0ed110f376b20643f6e64cb74dba291.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 - 2y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/0/7a06334068417b1781d14e8b28af827907961eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"16\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c43970aa97091f384854d477a1e1e07356887266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> in this case, meaning that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/9/a99c970d4468bc91a7ba9d8ae8d057a20d635a07.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 - 2y = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/4/234b330118777aba0bee513e3ade547ebd70d845.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />. The ordered pair for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/1/781a1eab5324128a6b9b805f38a10a53badd7f3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$z = 6$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/6/a766718d7dc59cd7b88f98c376e1ad9d948a4bd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{(5, 1, 6)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"71\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC\" title=\"2012 CIMC\">2012 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B Problem 1</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2012 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p